WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.920
Queen's Blade.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:09.470
This is a ritual of the gods, used to decide the strongest and most beautiful Queen.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.570
The one who is worthy to be Queen...

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.950
This is something that won't be determined until they battle.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:18.790
We can't find her.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.260
There is no sign of her here, either.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.760
The current is too strong.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.700
Let go of me!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.090
Just... leave me alone already.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:47.900
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:56.620
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:12.620
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:19.140
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:24.810
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:31.440
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
kotae wo shiritai

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
答えを知りたい

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:37.610
I want to know the answer

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:44.500
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:50.750
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:56.930
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:07.030
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.330
So this is where her scent disappears...

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.760
At any rate, it seems that the young lady survived...

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.770
Awaken now from your long slumber...

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.770
Be resurrected once more in body and flesh.

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:59.180
Become my faithful servant.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:21.710
Um... Is this how the enslavement ritual goes, I wonder?

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.330
That sounds about right, I think.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:28.180
How do you like her, Princess? She's quite the jewel, isn't she?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.100
When I found her in the river...

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:38.250
Her vitality, face, and hot and humid body made my tail hard!

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.400
And just what part of you is your tail?

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.020
Hi there, Menace.

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.550
Ah, it's Melona.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.910
How do you do?

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.990
What did you come here for, slug woman?

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.470
Shut up, you perverted cat.

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:55.230
Ah! This bitch!

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:58.250
This is the woman that did horrible things to me the last time we met.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:04.010
Oh my!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.800
We are in the middle of an enslavement ritual. Please do not interfere with it.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.480
That's how it is.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:17.660
Menace, you were able to be resurrected thanks to the witch of the swampland.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.440
Please carry out your duty.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.710
The only thing I care about is resurrecting my monarchy.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:27.070
I have no interest in anything else.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.110
Why does that even matter?

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:33.200
That kingdom of yours, whatever it was called, fell into a state of ruin anyway, right?

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:39.250
When you were betrayed by someone like this...

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:47.180
If you value your life, you shall never again take that form.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.280
I get it, I get it.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.520
Let's not make this into a confrontation.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:53.980
See you later!

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:57.000
Princess, it looks like it's almost time.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.400
It will be a great rebirth, won't it?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.530
Now, my new servant...

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.320
It is time for you to awaken!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:12.120
I have received word from Count Bansu that you are to return to the castle immediately.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.090
General?

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:17.750
Leina...

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:22.960
Onee-chan...

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.220
I wanted to sleep together with you... bathe with you...

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:32.890
I wanted to do all sorts of things... so many things to you!

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.820
As princess of Amar, I now command thee:

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.060
In subordination, become my servant.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.890
Please, just a bit lower...

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.650
Yes, Master.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.020
Ah! It feels so good!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:57.930
It's great that you "feel so good", but aren't you forgetting something important?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:03.340
An oil massage after a thousand long years is truly exceptional!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.550
Good grief! Well, never mind.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.010
Huh?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.180
What's the matter?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.280
Someone is headed this way.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:17.890
The clothing they are wearing is somewhat unusual, isn't it?

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.650
After looking...

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:26.630
This one is a lovely dress down type, but that will not deceive my eyes.

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:31.200
Hidden underneath those clothes, I see an explosive, dynamic body.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:37.460
Hm... On the other hand, this one looks like a delicate white flower, but has an impression of authority.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.470
She uses this to capture men's hearts.

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.420
She is definitely the playful type!

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:43.760
So? Who would you choose?

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:45.670
I don't want to rule out the one in red...

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.420
But if I had to choose, I am more fond of the other.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.570
Not that!

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.690
I would like to hear which one would make a more befitting servant!

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.350
Oh my! Sorry about that!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:02.900
The first thing I will do is test the abilities of these young women.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:10.820
So this is the Queen's capital?

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.280
Really!?

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.870
I'll be able to drink water! Water!

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.280
However, I do not see any people around here.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.870
No matter how you look at it, these are palace ruins...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.580
I can't go on. I'm already at my limit...

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.790
We drank all our remaining water earlier. Please bear with it.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:30.050
Please rain... Please rain!

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.440
That is only going to make you thirstier.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:35.040
Even if you do that, the rain won't come{fscx200}-

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.100
Rain...

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:41.400
Or not...

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.140
Please be careful.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.440
I sense an evil aura.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.930
Shizuka-san, over here! Hurry!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.010
Shizuka-san!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:01.920
After all that, the previous round of Queen's Blade wasn't concluded, so I'm told it doesn't count...

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.910
Leina's whereabouts are still unknown...

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:06.750
It's not my fault! Geez!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.670
Huh?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:10.960
Who are you?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.220
Vagrant warrior, Leina!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:18.640
What a terrifying evil aura! It's the same as that black sandstorm!

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:22.500
You should bow down before the authority of the Amar Kingdom.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.190
That's Leina! So she was alive!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.740
And to top it off, it feels like a Queen's Blade battle is starting!

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:29.870
How lucky!

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:33.190
This is the perfect chance for Nanael to show everyone her greatness!

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:41.430
You should bow down before the authority of the Amar Kingdom.

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:01.840
I am Tomoe.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.430
The warrior priestess, Tomoe.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.840
You're a participant in Queen's Blade, right?

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:09.110
That is correct, but now is not the time for...

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.470
It's okay, it's okay!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.610
With this, I can commence it!

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:17.190
Leina, the vagrant warrior, will face Tomoe, the warrior priestess!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.370
Let the gate that leads to battle open, here and now!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.120
By all means, ardently compete in this round of Queen's Blade!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.570
What have you done?

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.760
I will not fight someone who is possessed!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.040
Eh? Just a...!

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.500
Oh? Little birdy...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.800
So you were in a place like that?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.470
Even so...

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:39.890
It's not the usual Leina.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.120
For some reason, I don't feel like stopping by anymore...

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.730
Onee-chan! Thank goodness!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.900
My strong feelings reached you after all, didn't they?

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.730
Ah! I want to embrace you at once!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:10:01.070
That dull woman is certainly acting kind of strange, but what do you mean by possession?

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:07.620
I am not sure, but she has the same evil aura as the black sandstorm I witnessed earlier.

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:12.000
I am sure that some evil force is at work here, and this force is possessing Leina.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.860
And Shizuka-san is in here somewhere, as well.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:27.850
It hurts!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.430
Angel-san, please don't move!

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:30.920
You're rubbing against me...

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:35.400
Even if you say that... I'm already being crushed by your breasts!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.610
I'm sorry!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.240
I thought I was going to die!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:48.450
Save me~!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.780
That was very surprising, was it not?

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:55.090
I want to go home already, but I don't know where the exit is!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:55.710
What?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:58.850
What is it now?

00:10:58.850 --> 00:10:59.630
Water?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.250
We've been sealed in!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.030
I found an exit!

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:11.650
It looks like it will lead us out of here, but you can't fly, can you?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.730
Ah, she can't hear me?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.360
I feel sorry for her, but I have to leave her behind.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:22.540
Please find your way out of here!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.700
That girl in the red costume is doing quite well.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.850
Huh? Setra?

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:32.040
Where did you go?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.500
How regrettable!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.340
How very regrettable!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:41.970
Indeed, it would be very regrettable to just let her die like this!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:47.510
That's why I'm going to make a special exception for you, and allow you to become my cute mistress!

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:56.360
Are you some kind of specter?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.090
Well then, let's see...

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:02.710
I'll have to take my time savoring this foreigner's flavor.

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:04.860
Lick~!

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.390
Things didn't go very well at all...

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.990
Oh well, I'll try my best next time!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.770
Exit located!

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.880
It's still broadcasting?

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.780
I kind of feel bad for abandoning her...

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:30.000
If my reputation gets damaged any further from something like this...

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.690
Fine, then! I'll just have to go save her!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:33.940
Wait right there!

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.310
End broadcast!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.030
This place... will become my grave...

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.450
No! I cannot afford to die in a place like this!

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.830
Eh? She's pretty good!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.650
She's the warrior priestess, Tomoe, right?

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.520
She has a stalwart manner. I'll make a memo of this!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.850
You're Leina-san, correct?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.450
You should feel ashamed of yourself!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.710
To lose yourself to an evil spirit...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.250
You lack the qualifications of a warrior!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.500
Will you stop that?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:45.510
I won't allow you to confuse my servant!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.960
So you've appeared...

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:48.630
Vengeful spirit!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.920
Vengeful spirit... Just what do you mean by that?

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:56.560
I am the great princess of the Kingdom of Amar, Menace.

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.570
Amar Kingdom?

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:02.520
Yes. There was a time when it flourished, but it was destroyed long ago.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:07.680
It's surprising that elegant stories of the Amar Kingdom remain in a place like this.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.850
Neko-chan, can you read these?

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.990
Of course I can! But hold on there...

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.810
My name is not 'Neko-chan', it's 'Living Scepter'!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.540
So? What's written here?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.170
That's a story from a thousand years ago.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.910
My master, princess Menace, had been chosen as the next queen,

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:29.910
and lived a pleasant life.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.390
Well? It feels good, right?

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.560
Yes~!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.440
Princess, I will send you to heaven.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.150
I feel so good!

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:48.750
Of course, she knew nothing but a life of enjoyment.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:03.490
But then one day, due to her most trusted servant, Analista, betraying her,

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.460
the government was overthrown.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:10.460
The Amar Kingdom fell into ruin, and princess Menace was executed.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:16.850
After a thousand years, I have been revived into this world.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.670
Everything is for the sake of resurrecting the Kingdom of Amar.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:24.310
Now, you will also become one of my faithful servants...

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:30.090
and I will use your body for the sake of reviving the Amar Kingdom.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.240
You are mistaken.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:39.410
You cannot build a true kingdom, no matter how much power you may obtain from these vassals.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.080
People are not bound together by force...

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.170
They are bound by their hearts!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.090
I hate people that don't listen to what I am saying.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:53.720
Devote yourself to the cause of the great Amar Kingdom, faithful servant!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.810
You must regain your pride as a warrior!

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.770
Servant!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.760
I am Leina!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.750
I will not allow this to happen!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.970
Thank goodness!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.510
Leina-san!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.440
Nanael isn't doing so well!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.280
It's dark and scary...

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.610
I'm sick of this!

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.240
Beyond this area is the princess's main chamber.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.740
As expected of Neko-chan! Not bad!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.870
I can do a lot more than this!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.760
Tomoe-sama!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.600
Shizuka-san, you were alright?

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.690
Of course!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.520
No matter what happens, I won't drop dead and leave Tomoe-sama behind.

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:31.170
Shizuka-san!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:33.440
Would you two give it a rest?

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.280
You do nothing but get in my way!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.830
I can no longer allow this!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:38.710
I'm back!

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:40.320
You can no longer be forgiven!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.670
Even that servant...

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.790
became just like Analista and betrayed me!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.670
It seems like that Analista was quite the pitiable person.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.380
What did you just say?

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:57.430
I read the records of your history that were written on the walls.

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:02.450
The people ruling this country probably didn't notice it.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.360
In this kingdom of something or other...

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:08.700
The corruption started with small bribes, and eventually spread throughout all areas of politics.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.180
It seems the corruption eventually controlled the entire government.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:15.250
It's just like our country of Hinomoto, right? It's a well-known story.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:20.340
So because of that, it became only a matter of time before people surrendered to the enemy.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:25.080
I believe Analista and all the other traitors had to make a tough decision.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:26.890
Isn't that right, Neko-chan?

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.060
Who knows?

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:34.840
Regardless of the situation, isn't it a servant's duty to serve their leader to the end?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:37.600
That depends on the leader.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:41.850
There must be a reason for them to sacrifice their life for such a leader

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.390
if someone is going to follow their leader to the very end.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.350
Whether or not they find a person like that,

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.100
isn't that the most important thing?

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.970
Well, it is a story from a thousand years ago.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:55.590
It may be a bit too late to say this, but if you ask me,

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.750
it's all the princess's own fault for being an idiot.

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.350
What a disappointing princess, right?

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:06.010
So what you're saying is that the Amar Kingdom was destroyed

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:08.960
because the princess was a disappointment?

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.020
I won't accept that!

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:15.550
How could it be possible that everything was my fault?

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:16.350
Eh?

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:19.130
Why is that person angry?

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.270
I'll curse you!

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:24.890
How dare you accuse me, the princess, of being at fault!?

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:27.060
H-Hey, princess! Calm down!

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:27.950
Eh?

00:19:27.950 --> 00:19:31.850
It couldn't be... could it be... No way!

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.040
I will never accept this!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.700
Stop that, princess!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:39.210
Everyone... Everyone must submit to my will!

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:45.830
Bow down before my great authority!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.870
Eh!? What?

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.870
What, what, what, what?

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.300
What?

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.830
I'm sick of this!!

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.140
Let us escape, Tomoe-sama!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:09.600
Now, submit to my authority!

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:10.990
Is it that way?

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:12.480
Let's charge through!

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:16.510
Someone save me!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:18.780
I can't swim. I'll sink!

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:21.150
No! Let go of me!

00:20:44.350 --> 00:20:46.030
What a disappointment!

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:50.000
All of our prospective servants have run off somewhere, haven't they?

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.980
Huh? I was certain that you let them go on purpose.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.480
Today was a special exception.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:01.480
Then, you haven't given up on resurrecting the Kingdom of Amar, correct?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.220
Of course not!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:07.450
No matter what happens, I plan to resurrect our kingdom.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:09.640
That's right.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:13.740
For the sake of resurrecting our kingdom, we may have to become evil.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.300
That sounds like fun!

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.500
It's because of this that you are my master.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.180
I'll follow you no matter where you go, princess!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.420
Thank you, Setra.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:27.310
But let's pray in silence, at least for tonight...

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:31.310
For the sake of Analista and all the other servants of our kingdom that reside in heaven.

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.820
I thought we were going to die!

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.680
Thank you, Shizuka-san!

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:40.880
Yeah.

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.520
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:52.340
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuruu

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.340 --> 00:22:01.520
I can't express my overflowing feelings well

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
kyou mo sora wa tsuzuiteru

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
今日も空は続いてる

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:15.070
The sky will continue

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
keredo chigau kaze ga nagareteru

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
けれど違う風が流れてる

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.160
However, the wind doesn't match it's style

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
nando inori wa sasagerare

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
何度祈りは捧げられ

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:24.240
How many prayers have been raised?

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
sono uchi ikutsu todoita no

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
そのうち幾つ届いたの

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:29.130
How many will eventually be answered?

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
rekishi wa itsumo tooi monogatari

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
歴史はいつも遠い物語

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:37.510
History is always a distant legend

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
furimuku yo yuusae naku hito wa

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
振り向く余裕さえ無く人は

00:22:37.510 --> 00:22:42.680
You can turn around as long as people are there

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
saki wo isoi de iku keredo

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
先を急いで行くけれど

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:48.460
So hurry up and go

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
mamoritai kara anata no koto

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
守りたいからあなたのこと

00:22:49.940 --> 00:22:55.390
I want to protect you

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
donna ni hanareba naredemo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
どんなに離ればなれでも

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.110
Even if we get separated

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
sore ga watashi no negai no subete dato ieru

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
それが私の願いの全てだと言える

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:08.670
It is my wish to tell you everything

00:23:14.270 --> 00:23:15.950
Hi! It's Nanael!

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:17.630
This time we're in a village in Hinomoto,

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:20.290
a strange, remote region of uncivilized people stripped of their pride,

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:23.120
isolated from the rest of the country and seemingly devoid of life.

00:23:23.120 --> 00:23:25.550
I'll show these people my skills!

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:31.010
By the way, I completely failed at relaying Leina's fight. I won't let that happen again!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.470
If things go on like this, Nanael will be no more! I've got to take command!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.180
Be it an elf or anything else, I'll take on whatever comes!

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:40.310
Next time: Promise ~ Forest of the Watchman!

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:43.400
Let us be guided by the battles that take place here!
